  "description": "A fully managed .NET binding for OpenCV 5, derived from the OpenCvSharp5 project — image processing, video capture and analysis, camera calibration, object detection, machine learning, and the OpenCV contrib extra modules, with built-in Roslyn analyzers for common Mat usage mistakes. This package contains only the managed library; a native binding package for your platform is also required (CodeBrix.VideoProcessing.OpenCV5.WindowsX64 / .WindowsArm64 / .LinuxX64 / .LinuxArm64 / .MacOSX64 / .MacOSArm64, each with the .ApacheLicenseForever suffix).",
